  "title": "Gluten-Free Raisin Oatmeal Cookies",
  "description": "These gluten-free oatmeal cookies with ginger, raisins, and pecans, are crispy and chewy at the same time, and a great snack on the go.",
  "authors": [
    "Terri Johnson"
  ],
